{"server":"cn","storyId":"story_liskam_set_2_story_1","groupId":"story_liskam_set_2","stageId":null,"title":"尚待","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_liskam_2_1.txt","sourceHash":"3496a0a5746d5040e73ae956b899dec46383453695ab764a537f789c29609538","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"个人剧情 雷蛇2"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"我的......部族的情况？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，如果冒犯到你，我很抱歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"倒是没什么特别的。雷蛇前辈很想知道？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，实际上，我最近......在做一些调查。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"是和我的部族有关的事情？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，我不记得我们有和谁扯上过关系......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"甚至可以说，在我长大离家这段时间，连旅行路过的佣兵和商人都寥寥无几。更别提本就主动远离的其他部族。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"我想知道的，正是香草你在瓦伊凡联盟控制区外生活的情况。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"文献对此的记载十分有限，在混乱的形势下，想要听说各个部族的事情也很困难......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"就像香草你说的，这些部族过着几乎与世隔绝的生活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"我倒是不介意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，雷蛇前辈为什么会对这个感兴趣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"我所能想到的，也只有一望无际的荒漠，干燥，饥饿，为了活下去的生存技巧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"这些对我也有所帮助。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"我，嗯，没有任何恶意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"只是在做一些记录和调查......和瓦伊凡联盟有关的一切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"难道，雷蛇前辈想要回到瓦伊凡吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"暂，暂时不会有这种打算。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"至于以后......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"总之，先详细和我说说你的部族的饮食习惯、烹饪方法、训练方式和饲养技术吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"......啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"对不起对不起，没有撞痛你吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"没关系，我很不容易受伤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"咦？是杰西卡前辈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......香草。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"前辈正要去忙吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"没有别的事情啦，我只是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"去雷蛇前辈那边还一本之前借的书。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"书？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"真羡慕，杰西卡前辈和雷蛇前辈都看过很多书吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"对我来说，直到现在，阅读这么多的文字还是太困难了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"杰西卡前辈看的是什么样的书？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"是一本和瓦伊凡有关的书。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"瓦伊凡？是讲什么故事的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，难道说，这是从远古就流传下来的《瓦伊凡耕种养殖方法》之类的——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"让你扫兴了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"我看完的这本，是一部瓦伊凡战争年代的爱情小说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"瓦伊凡的......爱情小说？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"战火纷飞......战况胶着......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"在雇佣兵组织势均力敌的混乱时代，女主角为了爱情，不惜孤身闯入爱人的佣兵部队，乞求队长答应他们的私奔......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"这是真实的故事？那么，这是哪一个佣兵部队——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"我猜......大概只是借用了题材吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"真难得，大家印象中的瓦伊凡人似乎只有大块头的雇佣兵的形象。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"还以为大家对瓦伊凡的故事没什么兴趣呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈......我觉得这本书写得很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"有机会的话，还希望能够去瓦伊凡看一看呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"香草你知道，去瓦伊凡旅游有什么需要注意吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"去瓦伊凡旅游？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"很......奇怪吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"如果杰西卡前辈是想体验“地狱”的感受，我倒不是不可以为你保驾护航。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"这，这么可怕？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"在我生活的地方，可是连“卫生间”、“浴室”、“厨房”这种概念都没有的，一望无际的荒漠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"呜呜，这种生活，我有点......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，不过雷蛇前辈可是来自瓦伊凡联盟控制区，或许那里会和小说中的样子更贴近。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"只不过，和我住的地方比，那里的敌人不是单纯的自然，而是更混乱的社会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"控制区竟然比外部还要混乱......这是，在小说中没有描写的景象呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"老实说，我也不知道控制区里在经历什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"之前被雷蛇前辈询问，和前辈说起故乡的时候，她也只说过“不是那么太平”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然我的童年在部族里度过，总是在生死存亡间挣扎，除此以外还挺自由呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，大人们也说过，瓦伊凡的现状就是混乱不堪的样子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......详细的我也不懂，这种事情还是请教雷蛇前辈吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"她在不久之前还找我详细了解过部族的事情呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"咦，是这样吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"大概雷蛇前辈可以讲解得比我更明白吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，有关“爱情”的那部分......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"有机会的话，也可以再和我说一说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"如果能让你也感兴趣的话......我很乐意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"（现在正是因为小说的后劲充足好奇得不行的时候。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"（不过......香草竟然是这样看待瓦伊凡的。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"（听起来远比小说中描写的残酷许多。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"（不知道雷蛇前辈，又是怎么看待自己的家乡的呢......）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"打扰了，雷蛇前辈，我是杰西卡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"雷蛇前辈？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"我在，直接进来就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"我还要把头发吹干，杰西卡就先稍等一下吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"（哇......好像比上次来的时候书籍堆得更多了。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"（而且还有这么多报告。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"（雷蛇前辈不仅战斗实力很强，知识储备也不可估量。而且，一直这么认真......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"咦？这个报告是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"《瓦伊凡联盟各佣兵组织知名度及风评考察》？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"还有这个，是《瓦伊凡地区各部族概况》......找到了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"找到了什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"咿！抱、抱歉雷蛇前辈，我擅自就......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"呼——刚刚锻炼完冲了个澡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"杰西卡来这里，我记得是因为......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"我......是来还之前向您借的小说的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"放在桌子上就好，我会整理的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"咦？这本是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"出、出了什么问题吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯......不，应该是我记错了吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"既然是杰西卡从我这里借走再还回来的就没什么问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"呜，谢谢前辈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"那个......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"......还有什么好奇的事情吗，杰西卡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"我......嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"不要拘谨地站在旁边，先坐下来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"这里不是黑钢，不用对我做出那么礼貌的态度。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"好歹我们也算是朋友吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"雷蛇前辈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"果然，是我的话不值得信任......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"才没有，我、我明白了......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"噗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"杰西卡的性格，还是和以前一样呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"我有在努力改变......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白，和过去相比，杰西卡已经能够将坚强的那一面展示给大家看了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"不过嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"被吓一下就条件反射性地“炸毛”这一点，还是一如既往。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"呜呜，怎么连雷蛇前辈也变得和芙兰卡前辈一样了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"我可没有那么坏心肠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"是......不，不对！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"芙兰卡前辈也不是坏心肠，只是恶作剧总是来得太突然——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"——而且笑话很冷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"......咳，好啦，我尽量不损她。不然你也没办法好好回应。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，刚才你是对我书架上的哪本感兴趣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"与其说是哪本书......我，想了解一些有关瓦伊凡的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"瓦伊凡的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"我看完这本小说后，想知道更多故事背景里的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"雷蛇前辈一直十分关注瓦伊凡地区和瓦伊凡组织的事情吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"咦？你为什么会知道......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，我，我刚才不小心看到桌上的报告标题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"以及，听说......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯，倒也不是什么特别的资料。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"这是我的个人......习惯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"毕竟我是在瓦伊凡出生的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"离开了家乡后，我才逐渐理解自己家乡遇到的一些......麻烦的处境，到底对外乡人来说意味着什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"只是，我对瓦伊凡的现状也无能为力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"只能尽自己的能力更全面地去了解，然后再思考能做什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"我记得，雷蛇前辈在黑钢时就和我提过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"瓦伊凡需要一家与众不同的安保公司。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"......现在想想，当时身在黑钢却说出这样的话，实在是草率又天真的自己啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我觉得这是很远大的理想！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"毕竟，雷蛇前辈从装备部门找到我，还邀请我参与你和芙兰卡前辈的小队。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"也是因为前辈的建议，我才会来到罗德岛，让我改变了这么多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"那时的我别说梦想了，连一个可以倾诉的朋友都很难拥有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"我一直都很感谢前辈，就、就像香草被芙兰卡前辈发现——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"香草可是被芙兰卡从新兵蛋子里发掘的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是简单地做了黑钢人才库的筛查，很轻易地就找到了杰西卡你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"这么优秀的潜能，在装备测试部浪费了可就太可惜了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"......唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"......唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"过去的日子，也是回忆的一部分......呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"现在回看过去，果然还是太幼稚了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"擅自觉得只要完全了解了黑钢的运作方式，自己很快也能学会建立一个安保公司。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"过去几年，我一直只是关注着黑钢的发展。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，如果是这样的初衷，雷蛇前辈为什么去了生化部门？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"......一些瓶颈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"现在虽然能够看清，从前却迷迷糊糊的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"觉得自己理解的“和平”和黑钢要求的行动产生了差别，在执行任务时总是很犹豫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"如果那个时候没有被朗费罗博士要到生化部门去的话......或许会继续陷入自我的矛盾中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"杰西卡，你......觉得来到罗德岛怎么样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我非常荣幸！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"可以继续和雷蛇前辈、芙兰卡前辈共事，而且，罗德岛也改变了我很多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"以前在黑钢的时候，我没有什么可以倾诉的朋友......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，罗德岛有愿意听我说话的人......得到了很多的帮助。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"我认为，来到罗德岛对自己来说一定是至关重要的事！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......这样就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"前辈呢？说起来，芙兰卡前辈和你是最早来到罗德岛的黑钢成员吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"咳、咳咳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，是的，当时......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"那时的突然不辞而别，我紧张得不行呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"还擅自担心雷蛇前辈是不是抛下我们了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"后来才听说，雷蛇前辈竟然也和芙兰卡前辈一样，调遣到罗德岛了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"没办法，谁让我只有这一个搭档......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，那时的我也不理解黑钢的一些做法，可能比杰西卡更加迷茫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"那个理想也......搁置过一段时间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"难道，黑钢组织里有不为人知的......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"我认为黑钢是个好组织。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"只是......不知从什么时候起，我自己的想法开始改变了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"本以为黑钢的理念和别的佣兵组织相差巨大，是一种整合瓦伊凡本地散乱无章的雇佣兵、改善生存状态的最好方法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，信念和现实是两码事。原则和行动也并非完全一致。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"我，我也觉得......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"黑钢负责的业务可以表面上维持各个地区和平的模样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"但来到罗德岛后，我才知道还有更多严峻的情况。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"正因如此，原来那种轻率的构想我已经不会轻易说出口了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"比起一家单纯增加就业机会的安保公司，我想，更重要的是使命和责任。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"杰西卡，你听说过瓦伊凡目前胶着的战时状态和近乎无秩序的管理吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"以前只是有所耳闻，不过，这次看完小说之后......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"我想了解更多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"我以前也认为，或许是其他人对瓦伊凡的现状爱莫能助。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"第一次离开家乡去到黑钢，才发现几乎没有人清楚瓦伊凡地区糟糕的生存状态，也......没有人在乎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，我想让自己的家乡变成安全的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"能够让瓦伊凡人愿意回到自己的家乡，变得更加团结，没有外面的安全承包商也有自己防御的能力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，雷蛇前辈在喝醉的时候嚷嚷的“瓦伊凡需要一家带来和平的安保公司”，也是因为......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"是胡言乱语！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"瓦伊凡的资料......是我最近开始整理的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"我，我收集资料只是一种习惯，才没有什么远大的梦想！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"......不要嘲笑我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么会，我认为雷蛇前辈想要去做的话，一定能做到的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"从黑钢到罗德岛，从我认识前辈的那一天起，从来没有见过你偷懒的样子呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然来到罗德岛后，和芙兰卡前辈喝酒玩闹的次数增加了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"都是那家伙害的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"说要改掉我死板的毛病，结果却是用这么悠闲的方法......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，雷蛇前辈现在过得十分充实呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"也变得更加爱笑了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"我以为，芙兰卡前辈带来了很好的改变......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"其实，那家伙，虽然成为了感染者，却仍旧在想办法让自己的人生规划更加圆满。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"该认真的时候认真，该享受的时候享受。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"如果一直留在黑钢，那里可不会给成为感染者的成员这样的待遇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"更别说继续以搭档形式出勤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"芙兰卡即使成为了感染者，也能够立即思考自己未来的人生该如何度过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"我却，还是......有很多不足。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，雷蛇前辈不是已经找到目标了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"回到家乡，为瓦伊凡地区带来和平改变的方法......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"如果是雷蛇前辈，一定会比我考虑得更多，我，我是这么认为的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"我还......不够强大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"现在的我不如芙兰卡那般目标明确。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"以自己的能力建立组织，成为一名年轻的领袖，该做些什么还毫无头绪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"即便如此，一定有用我的力量可以改变瓦伊凡现状的可能性存在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"我这么认为。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"一定是这样的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"香草说，在瓦伊凡，有很多特别的舞蹈和食物，生活在偏僻的部族，虽然简陋......大家还是对生活充满着希望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"看来，杰西卡你对瓦伊凡的事情开始着迷了啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"因为......这本以瓦伊凡为背景的小说，故事和主角都十分特别。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"我认为，瓦伊凡的故事以后一定会被更多人喜欢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"我，我还想去瓦伊凡旅游一次呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"当然......只要我也有时间为杰西卡你“保驾护航”的话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"连雷蛇前辈也这么说......呜呜，瓦伊凡真的有那么可怕吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"现在的话，的确太危险了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"遇到劫匪还好说，如果发生佣兵之间的火拼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"这，这也......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，瓦伊凡一定会成为值得杰西卡你去看一看的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"不需要自己聘请专属保镖保护，穿梭于乡间、荒野和城市之中，进行无比自然的行动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"为了使之实现......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"（哈欠）哈喽，雷蛇，你在吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎么擅自就开门——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"你在写什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"不要擅自看我的报告。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？这本小说是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"也不要擅自动我的书架。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"《瓦伊凡爱情》......啊，这不是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"果然，这就是你的东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"这不是我放在你这的那本爱情小说吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"......你果然没放在心上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"这本可感人了，我还想好好和人聊聊读后感呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"上次明明借给你了，你却根本不在乎啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"杰西卡之前从我这里借走了这本书，看完刚还回来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"那我就和杰西卡好好聊聊，再也不向你这种扫兴的家伙推荐了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，虚构的故事，也没什么必须可看的理由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"这可是时下最热门的女性英雄的爱情史诗，还是鲜少的以瓦伊凡地区为背景的故事呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，虽然让本地人看哥伦比亚作者描写瓦伊凡地区的书会有些奇怪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，我也不介意听你对书中有违原本生态的部分批判一番？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"至少，你最喜欢的那段书信往来就是不可能发生的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"啧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"但是嘛......连杰西卡看完小说也能说出许多瓦伊凡的地名和姓氏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"还对瓦伊凡发生的事情更好奇了，借走了我好多的研究报告......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"小说就是有这样的魔力啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，可以考虑作为新的文化课题来研究......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"你啊，果然没有一丁点浪漫细胞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"只是题材的爱好不同。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"如果是科幻类的题材......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"没有爱情的那种。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"......研究武器和装备，不可以吗！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"说，说起来，你为什么来找我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......为什么来着？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"哈？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"逗你啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"有新的任务，是有关源石虫变异的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"我想着，哎呀，如果由我自己去执行，或者不把这件事情告诉雷蛇，会不会让她勃然大怒呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么样，要不要和我一起去探索一番？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"（深呼吸）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"（吐气）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"这篇报告倒是刚好完成。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"好的，好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"那么——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"刻不容缓，我们出发吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_106_franka","aliases":["芙兰卡"]},{"speakerId":"char_107_liskam","aliases":["雷蛇"]},{"speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","aliases":["香草"]},{"speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","aliases":["杰西卡"]}]}
